851697", "uri": "https://scontent-sin6-3.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/39031360_1625427428185030_2711203823001816376_n.png?_nc_cat=106&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=h40U-AAPj4MQ7kNvwGu4tQC&_nc_oc=AdorAMJfbn9tPPdhGS3iz0ZAyNj_GA_2pmFsdbiLK2a7m9VnaAdzbGrAK5Scj2qP-js&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sin6-3.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af9z2NfHIoHozzcPb41ie2SeKcqRnc-9b4ztKZgtcSdIGg&oe=6A22D06A"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "Lite.png", "id": "488641690876402", "uri": "https://scontent-sin2-3.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38974570_488641694209735_5817461652717182570_n.png?_nc_cat=107&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=AR_J1Q4oJIcQ7kNvwHM_blv&_nc_oc=Adr2p6GcUgAFxAwwLny3awMEteQJIIiEMJ4VTNNdH9k4jtmVODO7QZHeSK6JgPTgDxg&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sin2-3.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af-egq7x_ePqZ0y1dFVmMzhV_i69y1sFWnPc3Mcdv0ps4g&oe=6A22E29E"}, "display_name": "Skillveri Aura MR Lite Welding Simulator", "keywords": ["Aura", "MR", "Lite", "Welding", "Skillveri"], "long_description": "The welding simulator trusted by industries, schools, and colleges is now yours to try ! Perform GMAW welding with Butt joint in 2G & T joint in 2F, on mild steel at 1/8 inches thickness. Progress through multiple difficulty levels and get your performance analysed with a \tdetailed scorecard. Please note that this is the Lite version of our simulator. If you want your school or organization to buy our fully loaded, feature-rich Pro version, write to us at sales@skillveri.com ", "short_description": "The welding simulator trusted by industries, schools, and colleges is now yours to try ! Perform GMAW welding with Butt joint in 2G & T joint in 2F, on mild steel at 3.2mm thickness. Progress through multiple difficulty levels and get your performance analysed with a \tdetailed scorecard. Please note that this is the Lite version of our simulator. If you want your school or organization to buy our fully loaded, feature-rich Pro version, write to us at sales@skillveri.com"}]}, 